        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "How do you feel? All better now, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I'm fine..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I'm totally fine, I'm sure of it. The both of us are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I'm going out for a bit, so stay put here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "You're going out again the moment you feel a little better?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I've got work to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "That's fine and all, but shouldn't you at least wait until you've recovered?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Don't worry about me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "Hibiscus said the same thing. After you wake up, it'd be best to keep resting for a while and monitoring your condition."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "It's an emergency, one that can't wait. Alright?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "But, there's not a whole lot of time left until the concert. I think the most important to do until then is to make sure you're healthy and well-practiced... I'm sure that's what you want too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Can you stop pestering me with that right now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "Pestering?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "That's not what I meant."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "But I have to go, so don't get in my way. I'll be back as soon as I can."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "And you really... can't tell me what you're going to do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "If everything goes well... you'll know soon enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Oh right, your suit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kreide",
        "text": "What about it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I made an appointment to pick it up this afternoon, but I won't be able to go with you. You should go get it yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Remember to bring your cello with you and play a little passage as you're trying it on. Make sure there aren't any areas that feel uncomfortable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I'll be back."
    },
